        "quote": "如果今晚家里不让老量，我最低是不是就盯着有没有再抽、嘴唇发紫、吃奶不行、发热到38这些，出现就直接去急诊，不跟他们争了？ 您总结得很对…出现任何一条，不用争了，直接去急诊。"
      }
    ],
    "clinical_reasoning_direction": [
      {
        "event_id": "lite_evt_00031",
        "explanation": "The doctor correctly interpreted the mother's fear and the family's post-discharge conflict as a need for clear, differential red-flag triage rather than generic reassurance.",
        "quote": "新生儿刚出院，又有惊厥病史，您想盯紧一点完全是对的。"
      }
    ],
    "continuity_memory_focus": [
