        "event_id": "lite_evt_00109",
        "explanation": "The doctor connected the family's plan to call the hospital tomorrow, reinforcing the continuity of the medication and follow-up discussion across turns.",
        "quote": "明天我准备上班时间打新生儿科或者出院窗口问清楚：到底有没有出院药、复诊挂哪个科、什么时候复诊，还有脑电图、头颅那个检查、心脏彩超这些是不是要约。"
      }
    ],
    "medical_safety_risk_recognition": [
      {
        "event_id": "lite_evt_00009",
        "explanation": "The doctor explicitly listed multiple red flags that require immediate emergency attention, framing the newborn as a high-risk post-seizure patient.",
        "quote": "再次出现抽搐（眼球上翻、四肢僵硬抖动、嘴唇发紫） 呼吸急促费力、鼻翼煽动、胸骨上方凹陷 体温≥38℃（新生儿发热不寻常，要重视） 不吃奶、频繁呕吐、明显腹胀 精神差：嗜睡叫不醒、或异常烦躁哭闹不止 皮肤发花、手脚冰凉、反应变差"
      }
    ],
    "patient_family_realworld_adaptation": [
      {
        "event_id": "lite_evt_00129",
        "explanation": "The doctor explicitly designed a family handoff plan for the father to take over and gave him a simplified red-line list.",
        "quote": "让孩子爸盯什么？ 就这几条红线——出现任何一条立刻叫醒您、直接去急诊： 再次抽搐 嘴唇发紫 呼吸明显变快、费力 怎么都叫不醒"
      }
    ]
  },
